WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 13.1 · Strategy to Action: Plan, Deliver & Review
From strategy to annual plan

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
An annual plan turns strategy into this year’s few priorities, and names what waits.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Start from each coded objective, not from activities.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Choose few priorities; capacity and funding set limits.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Name what you postpone and when you’ll decide.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Imara Girls in Science (Registered nonprofit · delivering, Kenya)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“ISO1: replace Foundation A’s income for 2028 with a Foundation C proposal and a monthly giving test. Lead: Achieng.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write this year’s cascade and what you postpone.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
